  "content": [
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "h",
          "text": [
            "This installation was showcased at the LUMA Festival in Binghamton, NY (2024), projected at massive scale for a crowd of 30,000. It was first exhibited as part of the Art, Design, & AI Exhibition hosted by Parsons School of Design and LG AI Research in New York (2023)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "size": "h",
          "src": "/media/andWordsWillEchoInMySoul/LUMA_peopleInteracting.mp4",
          "alt": "LUMA Festival projection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "Mirrors have this incredible power of capturing our attention whenever we encounter it. Everytime we look at one, we immediately primp and scrutinize ourselves. In this intimate act of self-reflection, we tend to magnify what we perceive as flaws, even if they are nearly imperceptible to others."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t2",
          "src": "/media/andWordsWillEchoInMySoul/Hero_Image.webp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "h",
          "src": "/media/andWordsWillEchoInMySoul/LUMA_peopleInteracting.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "size": "h",
          "src": "/media/andWordsWillEchoInMySoul/insecurityMirror.mp4",
          "alt": "Installation demo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "This interactive installation makes these silent criticisms vehemently visible and tangible. By confronting these thoughts head-on, individuals are provided a platform to gain a deeper perspective on their own self-talk and body image concerns. Viewers are invited to contemplate the profound impact of their inner narratives on their self-perception."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "Sticks and stones may break my bones..."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "\"...but words will echo in my soul.\""
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
